WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.540
J. Beauty by Whisker. Hi,

00:00:02.541 --> 00:00:06.301
I'm Dr. Andrew Markey with 40 years experience as a dermatologist.

00:00:06.302 --> 00:00:09.261
I love both K Beauty and J. Beauty.

00:00:09.262 --> 00:00:12.421
K. Beauty is characterized by innovation,

00:00:12.422 --> 00:00:15.401
multiple layers, latest hero,

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:16.740
new product. J.

00:00:16.741 --> 00:00:20.221
Beauty is a little bit more conservative,

00:00:20.222 --> 00:00:23.301
slightly less steps, maintenance,

00:00:23.302 --> 00:00:25.221
and a more consistent regime.

00:00:25.222 --> 00:00:26.861
So they're both very exciting.

00:00:26.862 --> 00:00:30.061
In fact, the boundary between them is merging.

00:00:30.062 --> 00:00:34.261
It's more of a cultural difference rather than a scientific difference.

00:00:34.262 --> 00:00:38.461
But because of the consistency and less layers,

00:00:38.462 --> 00:00:42.825
as a dermatologist, I'm going to give J. Beauty just the edge.
